---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | ConsiliumBots"
  description="How the ConsiliumBots website handles analytics, cookies, and personal information."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>How this website handles analytics, cookies, and personal information.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap policy">
      <p class="policy-date">Last updated: August 29, 2026</p>

      <h2>Scope</h2>
      <p>
        This notice covers the ConsiliumBots website at www.consiliumbots.com. The information
        tools we build and operate with government partners (chatbots, feedback reports, and
        related services) run on separate infrastructure and are governed by the agreements and
        privacy terms of each program — not by this notice.
      </p>

      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This site has no user accounts and no forms, and asks for no personal information. The
        only data collected is usage analytics through Google Analytics 4, which sets cookies to
        measure page views and approximate, aggregated audience statistics (such as country and
        device type). We use this solely to understand which content is useful.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics and your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can prevent analytics collection by blocking cookies for this site in your browser, by
        using a content blocker, or with Google's own
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          opt-out browser add-on</a>. Google's handling of analytics data is described in the
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Google Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log visitor IP addresses for security and
        operational purposes, as described in
        <a
          href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/what-is-github-pages#data-collection"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >GitHub's documentation</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Pages on this site link to partner organizations, government services, journals, and
        research repositories. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which we do not
        control.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this notice can be directed to our offices listed on the
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or via
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/consiliumbots/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .policy-date {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .policy h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin: 32px 0 10px;
  }
  .policy p {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .policy a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
